  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop brown onion. Finely chop garlic. Pick thyme leaves.\n• Trim green beans, then roughly chop. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6475964378869f89b209a256/step-28f5577d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat 1/2 the butter with a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 5 minutes.\n• Add garlic and thyme and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add arborio rice, stirring to coat. Add the water (2 cups for 2 people / 4 cups for 4 people) and vegetable stock pot. Bring to the boil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6475964378869f89b209a256/step-e78bc662.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer risotto mixture to a baking dish. Cover tightly with foil, then bake for 20 minutes.\n• Remove risotto from oven. Stir through green beans and a splash of water.\n• Re-cover with foil, then bake until liquid is absorbed, beans are tender and rice is 'al dente', a further 5-8 minutes. TIP: 'Al dente' rice is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6475964378869f89b209a256/step-3340c49f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice lemon into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6475964378869f89b209a256/step-b780d7ef.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the risotto is ready, stir through 1/2 the shaved Parmesan cheese, red pesto, a squeeze of lemon juice and remaining butter.\n• Stir through baby spinach leaves until wilted. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6475964378869f89b209a256/step-88cfeb4b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide red pesto and veggie risotto between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with remaining Parmesan and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using).\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6475964378869f89b209a256/step-a8f6cc5b.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
